{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Garden Rivals is a PvP game for 4, 6, or 8 players, divided into teams of 2.</strong>\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Be the first team to grow your flower to full bloom.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The match is divided into two phases:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Night Phase</strong> \u2013 Players scout the map, locate your objective : the fertilizer. Opponents are invisible during this phase, making stealth and coordination essential.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Day Phase</strong> \u2013 All teams become visible and fight to secure fertilizer and bring it back home.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >   <strong>STEAL YOUR ENEMIES</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189780/extras/a5689fa4f6c2004b569f3ae7814c7385.poster.avif?t=1761432544\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189780/extras/a5689fa4f6c2004b569f3ae7814c7385.webm?t=1761432544\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189780/extras/a5689fa4f6c2004b569f3ae7814c7385.mp4?t=1761432544\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189780/extras/f91de2695b5543bf4e890c791caefcaf.poster.avif?t=1761432544\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189780/extras/f91de2695b5543bf4e890c791caefcaf.webm?t=1761432544\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189780/extras/f91de2695b5543bf4e890c791caefcaf.mp4?t=1761432544\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></